    "title": "Memory Vessel",
    "slug": "memory-vessel",
    "artist": 3,
    "category": 2,
    "image": "artworks/407294360064397565.jfif",
    "short_description": "A sculptural vessel shaped by ideas of inheritance, family and the passing of stories between generations.",
    "description": "Memory Vessel draws from the traditional language of containers while deliberately avoiding functional form. Its irregular surface carries impressions made by hand, with areas of natural oxide revealing the material beneath. The work reflects on the objects through which families preserve memory and pass knowledge from one generation to another.",
