    "artist": 4,
    "category": 3,
    "image": "artworks/1152147517213174092.jfif",
    "short_description": "An atmospheric composition built from fragments of architecture, figures and afternoon light.",
    "description": "The Long Afternoon brings together fragments of remembered spaces rather than depicting a single identifiable location. Charcoal lines sit beneath translucent acrylic washes, creating a layered surface that shifts between architectural clarity and abstraction. The work explores the feeling of time slowing down during an ordinary afternoon.",
