    "title": ". Roots Remember",
    "slug": "roots-remember",
    "artist": 1,
    "category": 4,
    "image": "",
    "short_description": "A hand-carved sculptural work celebrating the resilience and memory held within old timber.",
    "description": "Roots Remember was carved from reclaimed olive wood, preserving many of the natural cracks, knots and irregularities found in the original timber. Rather than concealing these marks, the artist incorporates them into the form. Small brass interventions provide a quiet contrast to the organic surface, suggesting continuity between past and present.",
    "medium": "Reclaimed olive wood and brass",
    "year": 2023,
    "dimensions": "72 × 38 × 26 cm",
